OL,3,GNEWSA'Dangerous predator' secretly
OL,4,Afilmed children
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "dangerous online sexual predator"
OL,7,Fwho secretly filmed children and was
OL,8,Ffound with more than 87,000 indecent
OL,9,Fimages of youngsters has been jailed.
OL,11,FRichard Pooley, aged 60, of no fixed
OL,12,Fabode, was sentenced to three years and
OL,13,F10 months imprisonment at Bradford
OL,14,FCrown Court on Thursday.
OL,16,FPC William Metcalf said Pooley was one
OL,17,Fof the "worst cases of indecent images
OL,18,Fof children I have ever seen in my
OL,19,Fcareer".
